<p>Tirupati temple in Andhra Pradesh dedicated to Sri Venkateswara is the richest temple of India. People believe worshipping Sri Venkateswara can lead to Moksha. The main gate of the temple bears the figures of Hanuman, Kevale Narasimha and Lakshmi Narasimha. The three prakarams has many mandapams....</p>
				
