					<p>The Meenakshi Temple in Tamil Nadu's Madurai is in lotus shape. It was built by the Pandya King Kulasekara. The temple is dedicated to Lord Shiva. The fantastic and splendid idols of Goddess Parvati as Meenakshi and Lord Shiva as Sundareshvara are seated here....</p>
				
